# Godzilla STE recomp — public export ignore rules
# Never commit game data, generated/lifted code, secrets, or local tooling state.

# --- game data / disc images / executables ---
*.iso
*.xiso
*.xbe
*.xbx
*.xex
*.xcp
*.bin

# extracted disc / media assets
*.dds
*.tga
*.wxv
*.mic
*.xwm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.wma
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm

# --- AI-upscaled / derived game assets ---
**/texturepacks/**
**/upscaled/**
**/ai_textures/**
**/*upscale*/**

# --- generated or lifted from game binary ---
recomp_*.c
recomp_*.h
recomp_*.cpp
recomp_*.hpp
recomp_manual.c
**/generated/**
**/disasm/**
**/decompile/**
**/ghidra_export/**
FUNCTION_NAMES.tsv
FUNCTION_NAMES.*
KNOWN_RECOMP_CORRECTIONS.json
*.map

# --- reverse-engineering databases / dumps ---
*.gpr
*.rep
*.idb
*.i64
*.til
*.gpd
*.dmp
*.mdmp
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

